  "details": "Right now, the amount of languages you can choose is max. 3 languages for your profile.\nBut some people can speak more than 1 language, and we have also people who can sign more than 1 language. And there we have problem: 3 languages is just not enough.\nI think we should make it bigger until 6 (or 8) languages maximal.\nThis is good for 3 normal + 3 sign language or 6 normal maximal. Of course 6 normal languages is a lot but it's still possible.\n3 normal and 3 sign languages is already possible.\nNow i must decide between normal and sign language because 3 is already maxed very easy.\nCan you make it possible? Thank you.",
